01:36:19.250 --> 01:36:19.510
de prueba.

01:36:19.830 --> 01:36:20.950
Use conexiones documentadas

01:36:20.950 --> 01:36:21.810
entre puntos finales

01:36:21.810 --> 01:36:22.330
aprobados

01:36:22.330 --> 01:36:23.590
