01:36:54.550 --> 01:36:55.670
Mantenga el análisis rutinario

01:36:55.670 --> 01:36:56.650
enfocado en tareas de señal.

01:36:57.430 --> 01:36:58.330
Restrinja los registros

01:36:58.330 --> 01:36:58.970
identificables

01:36:58.970 --> 01:36:59.950
a errores autorizados

01:36:59.950 --> 01:37:00.870
